type: software
title: "Replication package for \"Reducing Hallucinated False Positives in LLM-Based Vulnerability Detection via Multi-Signal Focused Verification\""
abstract: "Frozen pipeline code (detection layers 0-5, multi-signal verification, PoC generator/validator/sandbox, Semgrep rule packs), the launchers of every experiment, the 253-item adjudication study, and the scripts that regenerate every table of the article. The raw outputs of the 964 run configurations (data/ablation/, 2.8 GB) are distributed through the Zenodo record and fetched with scripts/fetch_zenodo_data.sh."
